---
// Du dessin à la vraie page : Design choisit l'apparence, Code la construit.
---

<figure class="ca-figure is-narrow dsh">
  <div class="dsh-row" aria-hidden="true">
    <p><b>Design</b><span>Un dessin : on en change en une phrase.</span></p>
    <i></i>
    <p class="dsh-code"><b>Code</b><span>La vraie page, dans votre dossier.</span></p>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .dsh-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .dsh-row p {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 2px dashed var(--ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .dsh-row .dsh-code {
    border-style: solid;
    background: var(--family-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-block);
  }

  .dsh-row b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* La flèche : un trait et sa pointe. */
  .dsh-row i {
    block-size: 4px;
    background: var(--ink);
    position: relative;
  }

  .dsh-row i::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 50% -1px auto auto;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    border: 0.5rem solid transparent;
    border-inline-start-color: var(--ink);
    border-inline-end-width: 0;
    content: "";
  }

  @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    .dsh-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); justify-items: stretch; }
    .dsh-row i { justify-self: center; inline-size: 4px; block-size: 1.6rem; }
    .dsh-row i::after { display: none; }
  }
</style>
